  "details": "**Description**\nThe pointer selection seems jittery, even though the visible laser doesn't jitter.\nHappens in both the quick menu and the main menu.\n**Reproduction info**\nThe amount of time in a world seems to affect the bug directly. Rejoining the world fixes it temporarily. \nCouldn't find a way to reproduce it constantly as I had friends without the bug in the same build and world. The amount of time didn't affect them as they didn't have the bug at all.\n**Logs**\nhttps://gist.github.com/MrXpertt/0b90406d7d8b63cc78d6c1f4a8d517f6",
